Subject: [PATCH 0993/3799] soh: rename func_808BEFF4 -> BgYdanMaruta_Roll

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the params 0 action: spins the spiked log on shape.rot.x, knocks the player back on an AT hit and loops the rolling sfx.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Ydan_Maruta/z_bg_ydan_maruta.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Ydan_Maruta/z_bg_ydan_maruta.c  | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Ydan_Maruta/z_bg_ydan_maruta.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Ydan_Maruta/z_bg_ydan_maruta.c
index 11565b5c3..10029bcbf 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Ydan_Maruta/z_bg_ydan_maruta.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Ydan_Maruta/z_bg_ydan_maruta.c
@@ -14,7 +14,8 @@ void BgYdanMaruta_Destroy(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play);
 void BgYdanMaruta_Update(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play);
 void BgYdanMaruta_Draw(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play);
 
-void func_808BEFF4(BgYdanMaruta* this, PlayState* play);
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_808BEFF4: the params 0 action: spins the spiked log on shape.rot.x, knocks the player back on an AT hit and loops the rolling sfx.
+void BgYdanMaruta_Roll(BgYdanMaruta* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_808BEFF4 [LLM:HIGH]
 void BgYdanMaruta_DoNothing(BgYdanMaruta* this, PlayState* play);
